[D#] [C#],        Amanush bana ke chhoda
[D#] [C#],        Sagar kitna mere paas hai
[G#] [D#],        Mere jeevan mein phir bhi pyas hai
[D#] [C#],        Hai pyas badi, jeevan thoda
[C#] [D#],        Amanush bana ke chhoda
